WEBVTT

00:08.740 --> 00:15.340
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.340 --> 00:18.680
<b>I just reached my hand out
like a daredevil</b>

00:18.680 --> 00:21.980
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:21.980 --> 00:27.440
<b>No matter what I get, I won't
ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.620 --> 00:34.560
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.560 --> 00:36.630
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.630 --> 00:41.870
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.870 --> 00:44.910
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:48.180
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.180 --> 00:51.810
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.410
<b>Right away</b>

01:05.990 --> 01:08.030
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.030 --> 01:13.270
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.270 --> 01:16.370
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.370 --> 01:19.610
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.610 --> 01:23.180
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.180 --> 01:25.840
<b>Right away</b>

01:34.590 --> 01:36.180
<b>Please hang in there, Hakuryu.</b>

01:37.360 --> 01:39.690
<b>We have to get through this pass
before the end of the day.</b>

01:42.730 --> 01:44.460
<b>I'm hungry.</b>

01:45.300 --> 01:51.110
<b>I'm cold. I'm hungry. I'm cold.</b>

01:51.110 --> 01:54.600
<b>I'm hungry! I'm cold!</b>

01:55.240 --> 01:58.910
<b>I'm hungry! I'm cold!</b>

02:01.780 --> 02:05.490
<b>Shut the hell up. You're just
irritating me more!</b>

02:05.490 --> 02:08.890
<b>What?! You're the one who said
we should take a shortcut!</b>

02:08.890 --> 02:11.960
<b>I've already forgotten about
such things long gone by.</b>

02:11.960 --> 02:14.360
<b>Senile, senile, senile!
Senile water sprite!</b>

02:17.630 --> 02:19.100
<b>Shut up, monkey.</b>

02:31.310 --> 02:34.580
<b>What the heck?!
This is dangerous! Hey!
It seems Hakuryu has
reached his limit.</b>

02:34.580 --> 02:36.050
<b>What did you say?!</b>

02:54.840 --> 03:00.040
<b>What did we do to deserve having
to play this tough guy act?</b>

03:04.380 --> 03:06.180
<b>Hakuryu, are you warm enough?</b>

03:10.520 --> 03:12.650
<b>I'm tired.</b>

03:12.650 --> 03:14.320
<b>Come on, I'm gonna step
on you, monkey.</b>

03:15.690 --> 03:17.160
<b>I'm sleepy.</b>

03:17.890 --> 03:20.450
<b>What's up with your phony act?!</b>

03:22.060 --> 03:23.960
<b>This is strange.</b>

03:26.270 --> 03:29.970
<b>That the monkey said something
other than, "Sanzo, I'm hungry?"</b>

03:31.870 --> 03:35.510
<b>No, I meant this blizzard.</b>

03:35.510 --> 03:38.810
<b>I know the weather up on mountains
can easily become harsh,</b>

03:38.810 --> 03:40.620
<b>but at this time of year...</b>

03:40.620 --> 03:43.650
<b>Lying in wait is such
an outdated tactic.</b>

03:43.650 --> 03:45.680
<b>You gotta do better than this
if you're trying to hit on us.</b>

03:48.020 --> 03:49.590
<b>You're late.</b>

03:49.590 --> 03:51.020
<b>I waited for half a day.</b>

03:52.730 --> 03:55.800
<b>I don't remember promising
to meet up.</b>

03:55.800 --> 03:58.770
<b>If only you had just died
in the blizzard.</b>

03:58.770 --> 04:01.500
<b>You guys are pretty tenacious.</b>

04:01.500 --> 04:02.990
<b>I'll have to use force.</b>

04:04.610 --> 04:06.040
<b>Use force?</b>

04:06.040 --> 04:09.070
<b>Right, I'm planning on taking
the Maten Scripture.</b>

04:10.250 --> 04:12.540
<b>Is this blizzard your doing as well?</b>

04:14.380 --> 04:15.850
<b>More or less.</b>

04:21.060 --> 04:22.690
<b>Did I miss?</b>

04:22.690 --> 04:25.060
<b>It's so bad. I'm not used to it yet.</b>

04:27.260 --> 04:28.900
<b>Awesome!</b>

04:28.900 --> 04:31.400
<b>You're strong!</b>

04:31.400 --> 04:32.870
<b>What's your name?</b>

04:35.370 --> 04:40.000
<b>Shoryu. Next time, I'll make sure
to kill you.</b>

05:12.540 --> 05:14.030
<b>What?!</b>

05:20.550 --> 05:22.020
<b>What did you do?!</b>

05:23.180 --> 05:24.650
<b>Should I do the left next?</b>

05:25.590 --> 05:28.420
<b>Using weirdass techniques...</b>

05:28.420 --> 05:31.390
<b>Don't get cocky, or you'll be
regretting it real soon.</b>

05:33.190 --> 05:34.660
<b>What's regret?</b>

05:35.230 --> 05:37.700
<b>Things like that are so stupid.</b>

05:39.800 --> 05:40.840
<b>Those are...</b>

05:40.840 --> 05:43.410
<b>Awesome! What are those?!</b>

05:43.410 --> 05:44.870
<b>They're cool!</b>

05:50.750 --> 05:53.550
<b>Brat, don't get cocky.</b>

05:53.550 --> 05:55.520
<b>You feel like handing it over now?</b>

05:55.520 --> 05:59.010
<b>Sorry, but this is all you're
getting from me!</b>

06:00.160 --> 06:01.620
<b>What?!</b>

06:19.270 --> 06:20.740
<b>How do you feel?</b>

06:30.890 --> 06:33.250
<b>I love stoic children.</b>

06:35.190 --> 06:37.230
<b>I have a favor to ask.</b>

06:37.230 --> 06:41.420
<b>You're such a darling that
you'll say yes, won't you?</b>

06:43.300 --> 06:47.170
<b>I want the Maten Scripture
and the Seiten Scripture.</b>

06:47.170 --> 06:49.900
<b>Get them for me.</b>

06:49.900 --> 06:53.640
<b>You can do it, can't you, Shoryu?</b>

07:19.770 --> 07:20.640
<b>Damn it!</b>

07:20.640 --> 07:22.130
<b>Damn, I missed!</b>

07:30.250 --> 07:35.250
<b>If you finish your errand properly,
I'll set you free after that.</b>

07:35.250 --> 07:36.950
<b>You can do whatever you want.</b>

07:39.620 --> 07:43.820
<b>I'll give you a good luck charm,
one that'll give you courage.</b>

08:04.080 --> 08:07.380
<b>Now, don't you come home until
you've finished your errand.</b>

08:07.380 --> 08:09.980
<b>You understand, don't you, Shoryu?</b>

08:19.990 --> 08:21.930
<b>Did we get him?</b>

08:21.930 --> 08:23.200
<b>No.</b>

08:23.200 --> 08:26.600
<b>Why do you suppose he
hesitated for an instant?</b>

08:33.170 --> 08:36.580
<b>Hey, hey, what's that
weapon he's got?!</b>

08:36.580 --> 08:38.210
<b>It's awesome! Just awesome!</b>

08:42.420 --> 08:43.880
<b>Stupid monkey!</b>

08:44.450 --> 08:48.890
<b>That hurt! What'd he do that for?!</b>

08:48.890 --> 08:51.920
<b>There's nothing awesome about it.</b>

08:53.090 --> 08:56.000
<b>It's a forbidden spell of corruption.</b>

09:08.440 --> 09:12.610
<b>I went to such trouble to give him
that charm. You know, Shoen?</b>

09:14.180 --> 09:15.980
<b>My younger brother...</b>

09:15.980 --> 09:18.090
<b>My younger brother is sure
to accomplish his task.</b>

09:18.090 --> 09:19.990
<b>Do you think so?</b>

09:19.990 --> 09:21.290
<b>Yes!</b>

09:21.290 --> 09:23.590
<b>If you say so, then it must be true.</b>

09:25.430 --> 09:27.760
<b>Please forgive me. It was
impertinent of me to...</b>

09:27.760 --> 09:32.230
<b>I don't mind. It's you and me
we're talking about here.</b>

09:32.230 --> 09:34.220
<b>We're practically family.</b>

09:48.220 --> 09:51.120
<b>I do have high expectations
of Shoryu too, you know.</b>

09:51.120 --> 09:54.090
<b>After all, you two are
so grateful to me.</b>

09:55.390 --> 09:58.990
<b>I expect you'll serve me for life.</b>

09:58.990 --> 10:00.260
<b>But...</b>

10:00.260 --> 10:01.960
<b>What is it?</b>

10:01.960 --> 10:03.630
<b>You promised...</b>

10:03.630 --> 10:05.100
<b>Oh, please!</b>

10:06.800 --> 10:08.430
<b>You actually believed me?</b>

10:09.400 --> 10:12.000
<b>Of course it was just a joke.</b>

10:15.540 --> 10:21.620
<b>Fool, do you know how much
technology I've invested in you?</b>

10:27.660 --> 10:29.590
<b>Now, then.</b>

10:29.590 --> 10:32.930
<b>Since Shoryu seems to be
having a hard time,</b>

10:32.930 --> 10:36.590
<b>I think maybe I'll send you to Homura.</b>

10:39.470 --> 10:40.960
<b>May I...</b>

10:42.040 --> 10:45.940
<b>May I have the same charm
you gave to Shoryu?</b>

10:49.180 --> 10:51.540
<b>One charm is more than enough.</b>

10:52.150 --> 10:54.340
<b>It's more effective that way.</b>

11:13.300 --> 11:16.700
<b>You two, what are your names?</b>

11:18.670 --> 11:22.580
<b>Oh, fine, I'll give you names.</b>

11:22.580 --> 11:25.980
<b>After all, you'll be my children
from now on.</b>

11:37.530 --> 11:40.050
<b>Not here either, is it?</b>

11:43.300 --> 11:44.730
<b>What is it?</b>

11:46.130 --> 11:47.600
<b>I'm busy.</b>

11:48.800 --> 11:50.630
<b>War Prince Homura, am I right?</b>

11:51.870 --> 11:57.570
<b>Were you not taught to give your name
first before asking another's?</b>

11:59.010 --> 12:01.380
<b>I have no use for a name.</b>

12:03.250 --> 12:05.450
<b>You have business with me?</b>

12:07.050 --> 12:08.920
<b>I have business with the
Seiten Scripture.</b>

12:10.530 --> 12:11.990
<b>That's impossible.</b>

12:12.760 --> 12:13.830
<b>Even if it's impossible.</b>

12:13.830 --> 12:15.490
<b>Then try it.</b>

12:20.070 --> 12:21.530
<b>What?!</b>

12:24.940 --> 12:26.440
<b>That power...</b>

12:26.440 --> 12:28.710
<b>Do you suppose it's the forbidden
spell of corruption after all?</b>

12:29.380 --> 12:31.350
<b>Who knows?</b>

12:31.350 --> 12:34.720
<b>What? What? What's this forbidden
spell of corruption?</b>

12:34.720 --> 12:38.720
<b>Goku, you've already heard of it
several times before, remember?</b>

12:38.720 --> 12:40.760
<b>How should I say it? It's a
forbidden science and...</b>

12:40.760 --> 12:42.260
<b>Why is it forbidden?</b>

12:42.260 --> 12:43.720
<b>Well, that is...</b>

12:46.530 --> 12:50.330
<b>Shut up! Move your legs before
you move your mouth!</b>

12:51.270 --> 12:54.640
<b>What?! What's wrong with telling me?!</b>

12:54.640 --> 12:56.900
<b>It's rare to see a guy that strong!</b>

13:00.110 --> 13:01.570
<b>You're damn persistent.</b>

13:04.710 --> 13:05.180
<b>What?</b>

13:05.180 --> 13:06.550
<b>You...
What?</b>

13:06.550 --> 13:06.680
<b>You...
No one likes a persistent brat.</b>

13:06.680 --> 13:10.280
<b>No one likes a persistent brat.</b>

13:10.280 --> 13:12.690
<b>I'm not trying to get you to like me.</b>

13:12.690 --> 13:15.420
<b>What do you intend to do with
the Maten Scripture?</b>

13:16.290 --> 13:18.260
<b>It's none of your business.</b>

13:18.260 --> 13:21.160
<b>If you'd just hand it over already,
you wouldn't have to be beaten.</b>

13:21.160 --> 13:22.630
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

13:23.630 --> 13:24.970
<b>If someone picks a fight with us...</b>

13:24.970 --> 13:27.260
<b>We'll take you up on it,
even if you're just a kid!</b>

13:40.080 --> 13:41.980
<b>Oh, what a disappointment.</b>

13:47.320 --> 13:49.360
<b>Now, I like you.</b>

13:49.360 --> 13:52.380
<b>You use an interesting spell.
Who are you?</b>

13:54.860 --> 13:57.020
<b>I asked who you were.</b>

14:00.700 --> 14:03.300
<b>I am... Don't move!</b>

14:03.300 --> 14:05.170
<b>Serve me.</b>

14:05.170 --> 14:06.170
<b>What?</b>

14:06.170 --> 14:08.660
<b>Use your powers for me.</b>

14:10.480 --> 14:12.140
<b>Come over to my side.</b>

14:21.760 --> 14:24.060
<b>Poor thing.</b>

14:24.060 --> 14:27.130
<b>It's because you two wouldn't
listen to what I said.</b>

14:27.130 --> 14:29.720
<b>Bad things happen to bad children.</b>

14:31.930 --> 14:35.030
<b>You'll promise to be good
from now on, won't you?</b>

14:36.100 --> 14:39.370
<b>If you understand, don't leave
without permission again.</b>

14:42.710 --> 14:45.910
<b>All right, Shoen? Shoryu?</b>

15:01.830 --> 15:04.960
<b>Damn it, that guy is powerful!</b>

15:05.500 --> 15:07.470
<b>Sanzo...</b>

15:14.380 --> 15:16.140
<b>You don't know when to give up.</b>

15:21.450 --> 15:24.440
<b>A scripture wouldn't be
worth crap to you.</b>

15:25.220 --> 15:27.550
<b>I don't care what the scripture is.</b>

15:29.190 --> 15:30.620
<b>Then why do you want it?</b>

15:31.530 --> 15:33.080
<b>I'll obtain my freedom.</b>

15:36.660 --> 15:39.030
<b>What are you here for?</b>

15:40.570 --> 15:42.040
<b>Answer me!</b>

15:48.340 --> 15:49.810
<b>As if...</b>

15:53.210 --> 15:55.440
<b>As if I'd ever tell you!</b>

16:03.890 --> 16:09.560
<b>Too bad, you have so much power.
What are you bound by?</b>

16:11.230 --> 16:13.860
<b>Be gone. I'll overlook this.</b>

16:55.710 --> 16:57.180
<b>It'll be okay!</b>

16:58.380 --> 17:00.640
<b>I'm going, Sis!</b>

17:08.690 --> 17:09.860
<b>Don't laugh!</b>

17:09.860 --> 17:12.920
<b>You're such a brat, an idiot
on top of a brat.</b>

17:14.430 --> 17:16.500
<b>Don't you get it?</b>

17:16.500 --> 17:17.960
<b>Shut up!</b>

17:34.950 --> 17:37.040
<b>It's already too late.</b>

17:49.300 --> 17:50.760
<b>You won't get a second chance.</b>

17:55.500 --> 17:56.970
<b>If only...</b>

17:58.070 --> 18:00.560
<b>Earlier, before it was too late...</b>

18:05.280 --> 18:11.380
<b>Fool, what you want can't be had
in exchange for something else.</b>

18:13.220 --> 18:14.690
<b>I didn't know.</b>

18:15.220 --> 18:17.780
<b>No one ever taught me those things.</b>

18:18.390 --> 18:21.360
<b>Of course not. Don't be such
a whiner, brat.</b>

18:32.270 --> 18:33.870
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

18:33.870 --> 18:36.170
<b>I have no intention of committing
joint suicide with a stupid brat.</b>

18:38.050 --> 18:39.980
<b>You want your so-called
freedom, right?</b>

18:41.520 --> 18:43.010
<b>Then live.</b>

19:35.570 --> 19:37.070
<b>Sanzo...</b>

19:37.070 --> 19:39.040
<b>Did he...</b>

19:39.040 --> 19:41.510
<b>What in the world did that brat...</b>

19:43.880 --> 19:46.710
<b>As if I'd know, he went on his own.</b>

19:48.720 --> 19:50.180
<b>To the world beyond.</b>

19:53.050 --> 19:55.540
<b>Did he think there was freedom
in the world beyond?!</b>

20:04.700 --> 20:06.890
<b>That's why I said he was a brat.</b>

20:14.880 --> 20:16.340
<b>Such stupid children.</b>

20:16.910 --> 20:19.110
<b>Perhaps I didn't discipline
them correctly.</b>

20:23.020 --> 20:24.480
<b>Shoen...</b>

20:28.720 --> 20:30.280
<b>Hello?! Someone?!</b>

20:31.130 --> 20:32.960
<b>Isn't there anyone around?!</b>

20:46.040 --> 20:54.850
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.220 --> 21:06.620
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:07.960 --> 21:18.100
<b>Emotions like the sand
spilling out of my hands</b>

21:19.440 --> 21:32.420
<b>The words that pierced my heart
back then suddenly ache</b>

21:32.420 --> 21:43.860
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:43.860 --> 21:55.140
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:55.140 --> 22:07.320
<b>Now, I can surely walk
on and on forever</b>
